WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,160
Let's put all the old grudges away together

2
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:15,140
Kill me and take what I don't want

3
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:16,900
He was poisoned and killed

4
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:18,980
Vow to be holy and not to use force

5
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:21,220
I'll give him his life

6
00:00:27,730 --> 00:00:44,630
Come back and see him
